      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ce09c4ff1ef661188867ab5|full_name}: There's some crossed wires going on I think. You linked stuff in reference to ImageLoading. (Also GetPixels is an expensive operation that you do NOT want to run every frame like for a video lol)\n\nThey are referring to the USharpVideo player in Stream mode. This is a well known AVPro thing that is something that must be fixed in the shader rendering the video.\n\nKeto, if this is your world, double check that you have the latest USharpVideo version. There was a bugfix specifically for android being flipped for AVPro (see attached image).\n\nIf it's not your world, see if you can contact the creator to update the video player.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
